%% ============================================================
%%  SUPPLEMENTARY SEQUENCE DIAGRAMS
%%  Co-Working Space Application
%%  Scenarios: App Launch, Logout, Set Password (Google Account)
%% ============================================================


%% ============================================================
%%  DIAGRAM 19 — App Launch / Session Restoration
%% ============================================================

sequenceDiagram
    participant App as Mobile App
    participant Storage as Secure Storage
    participant Router as Navigation Router

    Note over App,Router: Diagram 19 — App Launch / Session Restoration

    App->>App: Application starts (main.dart)
    App->>+Storage: Read auth_token
    Storage-->>-App: Token value (or null)

    alt No token found (not logged in)
        App->>Router: Navigate to /register
        Router-->>App: Registration screen displayed
    else Token found
        App->>+Storage: Read auth_provider
        Storage-->>-App: Provider (local or google)
        App->>+Storage: Read user_id
        Storage-->>-App: User ID

        App->>App: Mark user as authenticated
        App->>Router: Navigate to /home
        Router-->>App: Home screen displayed
    end

    Note over App,Router: No network call is made at launch.
    Note over App,Router: Token validity is verified lazily on first API call.


%% ============================================================
%%  DIAGRAM 20 — User Logout
%% ============================================================

sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant App as Mobile App
    participant Storage as Secure Storage
    participant Google as Google Sign-In SDK
    participant Firebase as Firebase Auth
    participant Router as Navigation Router

    Note over User,Router: Diagram 20 — User Logout

    User->>App: Navigate to Account tab → Settings
    User->>App: Tap "Log Out"
    App-->>User: Show logout confirmation dialog

    alt User cancels
        App-->>User: Dismiss dialog — no action
    else User confirms logout
        App->>+Storage: Delete auth_token
        App->>Storage: Delete user_id
        App->>Storage: Delete auth_provider
        App->>Storage: Delete has_password flag
        Storage-->>-App: All auth credentials cleared

        App->>+Google: signOut()
        Google-->>-App: Google session cleared

        App->>+Firebase: signOut()
        Firebase-->>-App: Firebase session cleared

        Note right of App: Google/Firebase signOut errors are silently ignored

        App->>Router: Navigate to /login (offAllNamed)
        Router-->>App: All route stack cleared
        App-->>User: Login screen displayed
    end


%% ============================================================
%%  DIAGRAM 21 — Set Password for Google Account (First Time)
%% ============================================================

sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant App as Mobile App
    participant Storage as Secure Storage
    participant API as API Server
    participant DB as Database

    Note over User,DB: Diagram 21 — Set Password for Google Account (First Time)

    Note over App: User is authenticated via Google — no local password exists
    Note over App: App detects isGoogleAuth = true from has_password flag

    User->>App: Navigate to Account Settings
    App-->>User: Password field shows "Set a password" in amber

    User->>App: Tap edit icon next to Password field
    App-->>User: Show "Set Password" dialog
    Note right of App: No "Current Password" field — Google account
    Note right of App: Fields: new password, confirm password

    User->>App: Enter new password + confirm password
    App->>App: Validate: fields not empty, passwords match, min 8 chars

    alt Passwords do not match
        App-->>User: Show mismatch validation error
    else Password too short
        App-->>User: Show minimum 8 characters error
    else Validation passes
        User->>App: Tap Save

        App->>Storage: Read auth_token
        Storage-->>App: JWT token

        App->>+API: PUT /me/password
        Note right of App: Header: Authorization Bearer token
        Note right of App: Body: {old_password: "", new_password}
        Note right of App: old_password is empty string for Google accounts

        API->>DB: Verify user exists and has no local password

        alt Token invalid or expired
            DB-->>API: Auth failure
            API-->>-App: 401 — Session expired
            App-->>User: Show session expired error
        else User not found
            API-->>-App: 404 — User not found
            App-->>User: Show account error
        else Password set successfully
            DB->>DB: Hash and store new password
            DB->>DB: Mark account as having local password
            DB-->>API: Password created
            API-->>-App: 200 — Password set successfully
            App->>Storage: Write has_password = true
            App->>Storage: Write auth_provider = "local"
            App->>App: Set isGoogleAuth = false
            App-->>User: Show success notification
            App-->>User: Password field now shows "••••••••"
            Note right of App: User can now also log in with email + password
        end
    end
